{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119965","id":3787901761,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hxstB","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119965","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119965.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119965.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119965","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119965/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119965/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119965/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f17c3a8ce122f321c1c8547d3840791237c6a1e","number":119965,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `CanvasItemEditor::center_at` rounding","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #119961.\r\n\r\nMakes the rounding be applied to the final calculated `view_offset` instead of to the `offset` by which the `view_offset` was being modified.\r\n\r\nSimplified example showcasing the change:\r\n\r\n- Before:\r\n\r\nviewport_center|view_offset|offset|view_offset - offset.round()\r\n-|-|-|-\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(596.0, 410.0)|(0.5, 0.0)|(595.0, 410.0)\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(595.0, 410.0)|(-0.5, 0.0)|(596.0, 410.0)\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(596.0, 410.0)|(0.5, 0.0)|(595.0, 410.0)\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(595.0, 410.0)|(-0.5, 0.0)|(596.0, 410.0)\r\n\r\n- After:\r\n\r\nviewport_center|view_offset|offset|(view_offset - offset).round()\r\n-|-|-|-\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(596.0, 410.0)|(0.5, 0.0)|(596.0, 410.0)\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(596.0, 410.0)|(0.5, 0.0)|(596.0, 410.0)\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(596.0, 410.0)|(0.5, 0.0)|(596.0, 410.0)\r\n(595.5, 410.0)|(596.0, 410.0)|(0.5, 0.0)|(596.0, 410.0)\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if rounding is needed at all there, but didn't removed it to avoid potential regressions.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/follower